               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Low Battery: Left Ctrl light flashes red slowly. Charging: Left</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Low Battery: Left Ctrl light flashes red slowly. Charging: Left Ctrl light stays red. Full Charged: Left Ctrl light stays green. Turn On/Off Left Ctrl Light: FN + Left Ctrl (on by default). Sleep Mode: First-level sleep after 5 minutes, deep sleep after 30 minutes. No key loss in 2.4G mode.</photoshop:LayerText>
