               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Press Q/W/E briefly to switch Bluetooth channels 1/2/3; blue li</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Press Q/W/E briefly to switch Bluetooth channels 1/2/3; blue light flashes slowly. Press and hold FN+Q/W/E for 3 seconds; blue light flashes quickly to enter pairing mode. When connected successfully, the key lights follow the lighting effects. Bluetoothï¼šNUT75 BT1ï¼ŒNUT75 BT2ï¼ŒNUT75 BT3</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Short press FN+R to switch to 2.4G mode; green light flashes sl</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Short press FN+R to switch to 2.4G mode; green light flashes slowly. Press and hold FN+R for 3 seconds; green light flashes quickly to enter pairing mode. Insert the 2.4G receiver. When connected successfully, the key lights follow the lighting effects. 2.4Gï¼šNUT75 2.4G </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Short press FN+T to switch to wired mode; white light flashes s</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Short press FN+T to switch to wired mode; white light flashes slowly. Connect the data cable. Wired: NUT75</photoshop:LayerText>
