                  <photoshop:LayerText> Product Dimensions: L 314.8 Ã— W 136.8 Ã— Front H 19 Ã— Rear H 37.2 Product Weight: Kit â‰ˆ 1575Â±10g, Assembled â‰ˆ 1830Â±10g Connection: Wired / 2.4G / Bluetooth Compatible Systems: Windows 8 and above, macOS Power Consumption: 1. Powered by Lithium Battery: - Factory default lighting effect &amp; maximum brightness: 180mAÂ±10% - Primary keys brightest white + side strip flowing light: 160mAÂ±10% - Full white backlight of the whole device: 150mAÂ±10% - All backlights off: 18mAÂ±10%          - Sleep current: Less than 0.5mA - Low Power Mode: Total current approx. 2mA 2. Powered by USB 5V:- Battery charging current: 500mAÂ±10%</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Thank you for purchasing and using our Weikai products! To prot</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Thank you for purchasing and using our Weikai products! To protect your rights and interests, this product is provided with Three Guarantees after-sales service in accordance with the national **Regulations on the Repair, Replacement and Return of Microcomputer Commodities**. The product warranty terms are as follows: 1. Please note: This guide serves as the warranty certificate. It must be stamped by the seller to be valid and should be properly kept. For purchases made online (e-commerce platforms), no stamp is required; the electronic purchase record from the platform shall prevail. 2. Warranty Period: 12-month functional warranty starting from the date of purchase (excluding man-made damage). 3. Service Content: 1) Within 7 days from the date of purchase, products with undamaged packaging that do not affect resale can be returned or exchanged. 2) Within 15 days from the date of purchase, products with undamaged packaging that do not affect resale can be replaced with products of equal value. 3) Within the warranty period, under normal use and maintenance, one-year warranty service is provided for failures caused by the productâ€™s components. 4. The following situations are **NOT** covered by the Three Guarantees service: 1) The product has exceeded the valid service or free repair period. 2) Damage caused by use, maintenance or storage in violation of the product instructions. 3) Damage caused by disassembly by non-authorized repair personnel. 4) No valid warranty certificate or valid invoice (except those that can prove the product is within the validity period). 5) Unauthorized alteration of the warranty certificate. 6) The sticker on the bottom of the product has been removed by the consumer. 7) The anti-counterfeit label is lost, damaged or unidentifiable. 8) The product model or serial number on the warranty certificate does not match the actual product. 9) Product failure or damage caused by force majeure (such as earthquake, fire, flood, etc.). 10) Damage caused by using pirated software or virus infection during use. 11) Product failure caused by human factors (e.g. improper operation, transport damage, collision, incorrect voltage input, etc.). 12) Other failures or damages not caused by product design, technology, manufacturing or quality issues. 13) Warning! Due to the special nature of the battery, do **NOT** poke, puncture or disassemble the battery with sharp or hard objects to avoid personal injury.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
