                  <photoshop:LayerName>1.It is recommended to charge the keyboard only using the usb p</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>1.It is recommended to charge the keyboard only using the usb port on the computerï¼›</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
